<p>Hi, I'm <strong>Saad Koker </strong>-&nbsp;a Computer Science student at the University of Western Ontario (UWO). My passion lies primarily in back-end development, where I find <strong>Java</strong> to be my go-to programming language. However, I'm equally comfortable working with <strong>Python</strong> and <strong>C++</strong>, having gathered extensive experience with both.</p>
