<h2>Current Projects:&nbsp;</h2>
<h3>Tacticl</h3>
<p>Currently, I'm working on an exciting iOS app called <strong>Tacticl</strong>, developed using Swift. Here's the executive summary:</p>
<blockquote>
<p><em>TACTICL is an organization and route optimization app designed for trade marketers (TMs) and managers working for large-scale Fast-Moving Consumer Goods (FMCG) companies. Built alongside trade marketers, TACTICL aims to streamline field sales operations by helping users efficiently plan store visits, manage accounts, prioritize tasks, and optimize travel routes. The goal is to develop a simple, functional app that improves productivity and coordination between field representatives and their managers.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3>One More, Boys</h3>
<p>I'm also working on another iOS app called <strong>One More, Boys</strong>, using SwiftUI. Here is it's executive summary:</p>
<blockquote>
<p data-start="136" data-end="513"><strong data-start="136" data-end="154"><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">One </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">More, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Boys</span></strong> <span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">is </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">community-</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">driven </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">mobile </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">app </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">that </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">gamifies </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">enhances </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">group </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drink </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">tracking </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">social </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">interaction </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">through </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">real-</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">time </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">location </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">sharing, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">photo </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">sharing, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drink </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">logging. </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Designed </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">in </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">SwiftUI </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">for </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">iOS </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">17+ </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">powered </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">by </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Firebase, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">the </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">app </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">delivers </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">seamless </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">playful </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">experience </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">centered </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">around </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">camaraderie </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">accountability </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">in </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">social </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drinking </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">scenarios.</span></p>
<p data-start="515" data-end="805"><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Users </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">can </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">anonymously </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">onboard </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">with </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">name </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">profile </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">picture, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">then </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">join </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">the </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">shared </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">counter </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">where </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">they </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">log </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">each </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drink&mdash;</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">optionally </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">attaching </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">photo </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">location. </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Each </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">shot </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">contributes </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">to </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">live-</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">updating </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">leaderboard, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">showcasing </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">who&rsquo;s &ldquo;</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">putting </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">in </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">work&rdquo; </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">with </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drink </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">types </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">personalized </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">stats.</span></p>
<p data-start="807" data-end="828"><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">Key </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">features </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">include:</span></p>
