<p data-start="1744" data-end="1940"><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">The </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">app </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">places </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">strong </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">emphasis </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">on </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">lightweight </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">interaction, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">real-</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">time </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">presence, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">and </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">shared </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">experience&mdash;</span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">turning </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">every </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">drink </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">into </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">a </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">group </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">event, </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">whether </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">your </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">friends </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">are </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">beside </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">you </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">or </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">across </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">the </span><span class="_fadeIn_m1hgl_8">city.</span></p>
</blockquote>
<h1>ExposeBot &ndash; Executive Summary</h1>
<p><strong>ExposeBot</strong> is a custom-built Discord automation and engagement platform designed to foster community activity, reward participation, and blend entertainment with moderation. Originally developed for a tight-knit, high-energy Discord server, ExposeBot has evolved into a versatile ecosystem that gamifies interactions, leverages AI for dynamic content, and builds a lasting social culture.</p>
<p>At its core, ExposeBot combines a virtual economy, AI-powered utilities, and uniquely social features&mdash;like the &ldquo;Expose Bank&rdquo;&mdash;to keep users coming back daily. It rewards users with credits for playing games, participating in trivia, and even winning League of Legends matches. These credits can be spent, gambled, or used to impact other members (e.g., timeouts, nickname changes), creating a self-sustaining loop of engagement and chaos.</p>
<p>Beyond gameplay, ExposeBot handles daily announcements, sends motivational SMS messages via Twilio, logs meaningful user messages for future games, and offers powerful moderation tools disguised as entertainment. It integrates GPT and Claude for AI-driven conversation, DALL&middot;E for image generation, and multiple APIs to make each interaction feel personalized and fun.</p>
<p><strong>ExposeBot is not just a bot&mdash;it&rsquo;s a server&rsquo;s personality engine.</strong> It promotes retention, encourages creativity, and gives community members the tools to roast, reward, or ruin each other in the most engaging way possible.</p>
<h2>🔧 Technical Spec Sheet</h2>
<table>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Component</th>
<th>Description</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Language</strong></td>
<td>Python 3.10+</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Framework</strong></td>
<td>discord.py (commands.Bot, tasks.loop)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Database</strong></td>
<td>JSON (primary), MySQL (image metadata)</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>AI Integrations</strong></td>
<td>OpenAI (Chat &amp; Image), Anthropic Claude</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>External APIs</strong></td>
<td>Riot Games API, Twilio, YouTube-DL</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Voice</strong></td>
<td>Google TTS (gTTS), FFmpeg</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Deployment</strong></td>
<td>Persistent server via tmux; configured via .env</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Storage</strong></td>
<td>Local files (images, music), JSON state tracking</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Permissions</strong></td>
<td>Message reading/sending, VC access, nickname &amp; timeout control</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>🌟 Feature List</h2>
<details open="">
<summary>🎮 Economy &amp; Games</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!balance</code>, <code>!transfer</code>, <code>!pocketwatch</code> (leaderboard)</li>
<li>Blackjack with dealer AI</li>
<li>Dice roll with 6&times; payout</li>
<li>Trivia: Guess who said the message (based on user ID)</li>
<li>Robbing, begging, timeout commands tied to economy</li>
<li>League of Legends win-based credit rewards</li>
<li>Cooldown-protected daily <code>!beg</code> and automatic <code>dailyReward</code></li>
</ul>
</details>
<details open="">
<summary>🧠 AI-Powered Tools</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!gpt</code> &ndash; Ask Claude as a strict principal character</li>
<li><code>!imagine</code> &ndash; DALL&middot;E 3 image generation</li>
<li><code>!quiz</code> &ndash; Multiplayer trivia via Open Trivia DB</li>
<li>Claude-powered motivational SMS messages via Twilio</li>
</ul>
</details>
<details open="">
<summary>📁 Expose System</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!expose &lt;name&gt;</code> &ndash; Sends a random image from named bank</li>
<li>Images logged from <code>#expose-bank</code> with MySQL metadata</li>
<li>De-duplication via byte comparison</li>
<li>Feeds directly into trivia logging and exposure tracking</li>
</ul>
</details>
<details open="">
<summary>🔊 Audio &amp; Voice</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!music</code> &ndash; Play music from URL or preset folder</li>
<li><code>!talk</code> &ndash; Google TTS voice messages in VC</li>
<li><code>!leave</code>, <code>!pause</code>, <code>!resume</code> for media control</li>
</ul>
</details>
<details open="">
<summary>🎤 Social &amp; Voice Automation</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!createteams</code> &ndash; Randomly assign VC members into teams</li>
<li><code>!wehavesix</code> &ndash; Random picker from VC</li>
<li><code>!nickname</code> &ndash; Paid nickname changes</li>
<li><code>!timeout</code> &ndash; Paid timeouts that reward the victim</li>
</ul>
</details>
<details open="">
<summary>📆 Real-Time Tools &amp; Scheduling</summary>
<ul>
<li><code>!fixtures</code> &ndash; BBC football fixture scraping with timezone conversion</li>
<li><code>!remind</code> &ndash; SMS reminders via Twilio</li>
<li><code>!iftar</code> &ndash; Iftar/Suhur times by city (CSV)</li>
</ul>
</details>
